WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
A man stands in front of a sleeping lion with its mouth open inside a cage marked "Dangerous".

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
The man looks inside the lion cage with concern.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
The lion lies down in its cell with its mouth open.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
The man in a suit looks through the bars at the sleeping lion with its mouth open.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.000
A man in overalls stands behind bars, his hands resting on them.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.000
The man watches as the lion opens its mouth and growls.

00:48.000 --> 00:56.000
The man in a white shirt stands behind bars as the lion lies still, with a sign below reading "Dangerous".

00:56.000 --> 01:04.000
The man stands in front of a lion cage, looking inside at the motionless cat behind bars.

