01:12.000 --> 01:20.000
A man stands behind bars with his hands clasped together, looking at something in front of him.

01:20.000 --> 01:28.000
A man stands in front of a cage containing a lion, with a circus trailer marked "Dangerous" nearby.

01:28.000 --> 01:36.000
A man in a white shirt stands behind bars with his hands up as someone next to him says, "Open the door, quick!"

01:36.000 --> 01:44.000
A man in a suit holds onto a cage door while a woman watches nearby.

01:44.000 --> 01:52.000
A man stands in front of a lion lying down inside a cage marked "Dangerous".

01:52.000 --> 02:00.000
A man stands behind bars in a dim room with a dead animal on the floor.

02:00.000 --> 02:08.000
A man in a vest stands behind bars, looking at a woman kneeling on hay.

02:08.000 --> 02:16.000
A woman in a circus costume kneels on straw while another person stands behind bars.

02:16.000 --> 02:24.000
The woman speaks to the man as he stands behind bars with his arms outstretched.

02:24.000 --> 02:32.000
The man points at a lion inside its cage while standing behind bars.

02:32.000 --> 02:40.000
The woman walks away from the cage.

02:40.000 --> 02:48.000
The woman stands near two small buildings as a man climbs a pole nearby.

02:48.000 --> 02:56.000
The woman climbs onto a pole with ropes attached.

02:56.000 --> 03:04.000
The woman stands next to a man who is climbing up a pole.

03:04.000 --> 03:12.000
A man in overalls stands next to a woman, holding something in his right hand while she looks at him.

03:12.000 --> 03:20.000
A woman stands by a logo.
